#. module: fullyn_field_connector
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/fullyn_field_connector/models/res_config_settings.py:0
msgid ""
"Install Project and Timesheets so that field work can be allocated to "
"projects, tasks and sales orders. Without them, Fullyn Field works through "
"the Fullyn platform and sends validated data to Odoo by API."
msgstr ""
"Installez Projet et Feuilles de temps pour allouer les prestations du "
"terrain aux projets, aux tâches et aux commandes clients. Sans eux, Fullyn "
"Field fonctionne via la plateforme Fullyn et renvoie les données validées "
"vers Odoo par API."

